{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>涉鯉魚門道兩度猥褻露體，26歲男油麗邨落網。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>警方於上周四 (15 日 ) 收到報案，懷疑一名男子分別在同日及 9 月 21 日，在觀塘鯉魚門道猥褻露體。 人員經深入調查後，昨日 (21 日 ) 晚上於觀塘油麗邨拘捕一名 26 歲本地男子，涉嫌「猥褻暴露身體」。他現正被扣留調查，案件交由觀塘警區刑事調查隊第三隊跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T04:22:40.517225+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T03:58:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T04:17:57.140837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:17:57.140837+00:00","content_hash":"d24d38bd967fc4636d179633a6ec8f99c0858c6cca918f70b7ebe3af5a33bf25","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}